Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this has got to be the\Nclosest match I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.31,0:01:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,With just 50 life points separating\Ntheir scores, it's anyone's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let up now, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.29,0:01:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It all comes down to these next few turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.25,0:01:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister's counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.73,0:01:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Make her proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.91,0:01:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel has turned into\Nquite the nail-biter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.01,0:01:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, a virtual unknown going card for\Ncard with the Intercontinental Champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.11,0:01:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it is that fuels\Nthese splendid performances.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.27,0:01:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps my Millennium Eye\Nwill show me the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keith has been wading in a pool of misery\Never since that defeat I handed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's seeking his revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Joey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,These markings are a\Nsymbol of our friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:01:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and how we'll always be\Nthere for one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:01:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And a sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So while one is driven\Nby bitter vengeance,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the other is motivated by love and trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it's practically a\Nbattle of good versus evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get on\Nwith this matcha, dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I got plenty more machine\Nmonsters all revved up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and ready to totally\Nsteamroll your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.59,0:02:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you ain't nothing but a speed\Nbump on my way to duel Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And that goes double for that\Ndweeby friend of yours, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.29,0:02:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got news for you, pal,\Neven if you beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Which you won't. Yugi'd cream you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know why, Hotshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're a selfish\Nsleazeball who's only
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,in this tournament for your\Nown greedy reasons. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.55,0:02:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,People like you never win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:02:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, your tricks may\Nget you a little ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.11,0:03:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but only till people with\Ngood intentions show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Like me, and like Yugi, too. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.51,0:03:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,One card face down, and\NI'll attack with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.15,0:03:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My barrel dragon is gonna blast you\Nand your good intentions to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,See, with its triple attack\Nlaser discharge system,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.19,0:03:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,it has three attacks, not just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can clear all your monsters\Nfrom the field in just one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.97,0:03:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Three attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So say adios to your two\Nbuddies on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, proton blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.57,0:03:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing totaled them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what a 2,600-point\Nattack will do for you. Face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.31,0:03:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the line for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No monster you got is gonna be able\Nto withstand this kind of firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder Keith was acting so confidently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey really has his work\Ncut out for him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done yet, Keith?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I already figured out how\Nto beat you, little toy blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.29,0:04:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet the master of the past and future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.57,0:04:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The time wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That could work!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if that time roulette lands right,\Nthat machine monster will age and corrode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.77,0:04:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not done, Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing this baby down, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby dragon, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you got two things\Nto worry about, Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That blaster of yours rustin' up\Nand this little guy growin' up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, time roulette!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.21,0:04:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, if that time\Nroulette lands wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then Joey will have\Nsomething to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,His Time Wizard will be destroyed and\Nhe'll be at the mercy of Keith's blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in fate's hands now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're with you, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.11,0:05:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Time Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I really need you to\Ncome through for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't land on a skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.89,0:05:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Time Wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Time magic is causing\NKeith's dragon to rust up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.71,0:05:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's losing power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,While Joey's dragon is\Ngaining power as it evolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.57,0:05:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The stage is set perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Thousand Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:05:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Noxious Nostril Gust!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That hunk of steel is history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But history repeats itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when you're\Ntaking on a deck that's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.63,0:06:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,stacked with all kinds of\Ndifferent machine cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this trap, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap card?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my\Ntime-travelin' time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.23,0:06:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's in that chamber?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My time machine can travel\Nback in time one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.37,0:06:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can retrieve the monster\Nthat you just destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his barrel dragon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.27,0:06:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's back, and it looks\Nbrand spanking new.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All of its point totals have\Ngone back to full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, proton blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:06:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My dragon's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's gonna stay gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, unless you have a time\Nmachine trap set up to bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.35,0:07:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But then he'd be coming back a\Nbaby dragon, wouldn't he? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? Oh, right,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,because the time machine brings back your\Nmonster the way it was one turn before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And since Keith's monster didn't\Nrust over until this turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,it came back the way it was last turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfazed by Joey's time wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Punk,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were gonna\Nuse that dweeby little
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.49,0:07:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,time wizard to try and rust up my dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You forget, I saw every card in\Nyour deck when you dueled bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Duels are more than just\Nabout the cards you use.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're about backbone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And judging from the look on your face\Nwhen my dragon came back through time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say you don't even have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.81,0:07:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll throw a monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it is right, because my\Nmachines are going to keep on coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Go slot machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your turn, dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast that defense card to kingdom come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.03,0:08:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Proton blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I could throw a monster out and\Ndestroy Keith's slot machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but then he'd just turn around and destroy\Nwhatever card I play with that dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my strongest card of all, the red-eyes\Nblack dragon, wouldn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.55,0:08:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in a tough bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.19,0:08:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, believe in your cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to trust them if\Nyou're gonna beat that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.63,0:08:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to lay one\Ncard face down and throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the Red-Eyes Black Dragon in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.11,0:08:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And that'll do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.25,0:08:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That Red-Eyes Dragon may be the best\Ncard you've got in your entire deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:09:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,dweeb, but he's still no match\Nfor this kind of blasted power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.67,0:09:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Say bye-bye to your prized possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Proton blast attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.51,0:09:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little something called copycat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me copy one card that you've used.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm choosing to\Ncopy Magic Metal Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.59,0:09:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my red-eyes black dragon is\Na red-eyes black metal dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And that makes him strong\Nenough to withstand your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now Keith's\Ndragon is the one in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Red eyes, counterattack,\Nflash, flare, blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that, Keith?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:10:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your triple blast dragon machine has been\Nreduced to a pile of smoking metal debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.87,0:10:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And with my sister's sight on the line,\NI plan on getting even tougher on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Keith's dragon's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.43,0:10:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's Metal Red Eyes is the\Ntoughest card in the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but don't count Keith out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some reason he\Nplayed that slot machine monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were an amateur, and\Nnow I'm gonna show you how come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Amateur?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, didn't I just go and blast\Nyour best monster to bits?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.11,0:10:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep talking, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm laying this card face down,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm switching my slot machine\Nmonster to defensive mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, is Keith losing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.25,0:10:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That slot machine can't take a blast from\Nmy red eyes no matter what mode he's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.19,0:10:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll have to learn the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad move, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll lay this face down, And now,\Nmy red eyes will attack. Flash! Flare!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you're as predictable\Nas you are brainless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.71,0:11:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm playing the card I had face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, seven completed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.93,0:11:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How come that middle slot\Njust switched to a seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.27,0:11:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because my seven completed card\Nraises my slot's defensive points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,To 3,000 to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's more than\Nenough to deflect your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.73,0:11:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyes Black Dragon's strongest attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And because my attack is lower than\Nits defense, I lose life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.27,0:11:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.45,0:11:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That Flash Flare Blast is the\Nstrongest attack Joey has, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.67,0:11:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what else I got?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Two more seven completed cards in my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,each able to power up my slot's\Ndefense or attack by 700 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.61,0:11:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, just because you have them\Ndoesn't mean you'll draw them, Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.97,0:11:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I ain't too worried about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.09,0:12:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.73,0:12:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out what card I just drew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll go ahead\Nand take it for a spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.11,0:12:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This time for my attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't do something soon, my life\Npoints are gonna get cleaned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,One more of those seven completed\Ncards and that slot will
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,have powered up enough to\Ndestroy Joey's Red-Eyes Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.67,0:12:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And then the other card he has, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'm throwing this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Blast Sphere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And attach yourself to Joey's Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast Sphere? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I end my turn,\Nit'll self-destruct,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,giving off 2,900 points\Nof damage to your dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Self-destruct?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I thought I just had\Nthat slot machine to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:12:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ending my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Blammo, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.51,0:13:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But that dragon should be blown to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.25,0:13:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my handy Dragon Nails card,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,it made my red eyes 600\Nattack points stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.27,0:13:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the blast got deflected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You dweeb, now my life points go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're gonna make me cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you cry, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, looky what I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll power up\Nmy slot's attack again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Both their monsters have\Nthe same attack points now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:14:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And Joey and Keith have almost the exact\Nsame amount of life points remaining, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.77,0:14:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This next turn could\Ndecide the whole match.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The shield and sword card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.25,0:14:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing this would swap all monsters'\Ndefense points with their attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but that'd only help Keith out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, no card you play's gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just end your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I think I'll go ahead\Nand end this duel. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.57,0:14:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pillager.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.77,0:14:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pillager lets me look at your duel\Nin hand and steal one card from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So lay him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.85,0:14:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.77,0:14:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The shield and sword card, perfect.\NI think I'll take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, you were through.\NGo, shield and sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,swamp attack points with defense points
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go slot machine, plasma laser cannon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.05,0:15:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate trap Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I win! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.23,0:15:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The dweeb had a Grave Robert card?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And he used it to bring\Nback my time machine trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have paid more\Nattention to my last turn, Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'd have seen\Nthe trap I set for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And since the time machine can bring\Nback a monster from the previous turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.23,0:15:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,then that means... Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My dragon's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And now his attack is\Nhigher than your defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Eyes, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And since he's back to how he was\None turn ago, his attack is higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,than your defense so good luck\Nblocking this go flash flare blast
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,no way he beat me he actually won\Nremarkable keith's rampage for
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.73,0:16:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,revenge was brought to a Halt by\Na novice dueling for a loved one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.69,0:16:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler, you are the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.61,0:16:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.89,0:16:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget how you helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.29,0:16:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel doesn't count! Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.39,0:16:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't count?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Keith just doesn't know when to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:17:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The entry card that Joey showed to\Nplay in this match wasn't even his.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, the duel shouldn't count, and\Nhe ought to be disqualified right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My card was missing, so Mike gave me hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But tell me, Keith, how could you\Nhave known that this wasn't my card?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.45,0:17:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So, why don't you explain yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.69,0:17:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.27,0:17:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear that Keith stole Joey's card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he was so certain that\Nyou would never be able to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.77,0:17:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You snake! I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.77,0:17:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That big cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Keith ought to be\Ndisqualified, not Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Keith ought to be disqualified, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but not simply for misdeeds\Noutside of the dueling ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There was quite a bit of improper conduct
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.85,0:17:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,taking place during the\Nmatch that I observed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.49,0:17:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.83,0:17:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so, Keith? Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Keith kept his set of seven completed\Ncards beneath his wristband.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That way he could power up his slot machine\Nmonster whenever he chose Man, Keith,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's low. Take the scoundrel\Naway, far away. Let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,come on Let me go, nobody makes a\Nmonkey out of Bandit Keith Nobody
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.91,0:18:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Joseph You should be\Nquite proud You dueled admirably Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.77,0:18:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Keith!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly are a stubborn one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't talking your\Nway out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hand over that prize money or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.69,0:18:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, certainly, Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give my body a moment\Nto recover from the complete
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.21,0:18:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,paralysis that your terrifying\Ndemands have shocked me into.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.51,0:18:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, wise guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you till three.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:18:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:18:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:18:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the finalists for the next match\Nwill receive a ten-minute recess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So rest up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Our host wants you both\Nin top form for your duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.19,0:19:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.25,0:19:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we can't put\Nthis off any longer, bud
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.01,0:19:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it To save my grandpa\NI must duel my best friend
